        "נסמן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=xy</annotation></semantics></math></span>. אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x\\,g(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_x=y</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_y=x</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
        "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>g</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_x=x\\,g&#x27;(t)\\cdot y</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
        "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>g</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>g</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_y=x\\,g&#x27;(t)\\cdot x=x^2g&#x27;(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
