      "explanationHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=2x+3y</annotation></semantics></math></span> ליניארי: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>g</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_{xx}=4g&#x27;&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>g</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_{yy}=9g&#x27;&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><msup><mi>g</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>36</mn><msup><mi>g</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9z_{xx}-4z_{yy}=36g&#x27;&#x27;-36g&#x27;&#x27;=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>. השאר נותנים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\cdot4-2\\cdot9=-6</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4-9=-5</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\cdot4-3\\cdot9=-19</annotation></semantics></math></span> כפולות של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>g</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g&#x27;&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span>, שאינן אפס בכל נקודה.",
