      "explanationHtml": "התחום <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\le y\\le\\sqrt x</annotation></semantics></math></span> חסום בין הישר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x</annotation></semantics></math></span> לפרבולה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\sqrt x</annotation></semantics></math></span> (כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=y^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>), ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span> נע מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span> עד <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span>. בגובה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span> הקו האופקי נכנס דרך הפרבולה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=y^2</annotation></semantics></math></span> ויוצא דרך הישר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=y</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^2\\le y</annotation></semantics></math></span> ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^2\\le x\\le y</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הגבולות ההפוכים (<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\le x\\le y^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>) נותנים תחום ריק, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><msqrt><mi>y</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\le x\\le\\sqrt y</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא התחום שבין הישר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=y</annotation></semantics></math></span> לפרבולה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>y</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\sqrt y</annotation></semantics></math></span> (התחום המשתקף), ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><msqrt><mi>y</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^2\\le x\\le\\sqrt y</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא תחום גדול יותר.",
