      "step": {
       "type": "numeric",
       "prompt": "מהו הערך המקסימלי של אותה $f(x,y)=x^2+xy+y^2-6x$ באותו משולש?",
       "answer": 16,
       "tol": 0,
       "explain": "המועמדים: $(3,0)$ עם $-9$, והקודקודים $(0,0)$ עם $0$, ‏$(4,0)$ עם $16-24=-8$, ‏$(0,4)$ עם $16$. הגדול ביותר הוא $16$, בקודקוד $(0,4)$.",
       "promptHtml": "מהו הערך המקסימלי של אותה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x,y)=x^2+xy+y^2-6x</annotation></semantics></math></span> באותו משולש?",
       "explainHtml": "המועמדים: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(3,0)</annotation></semantics></math></span> עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-9</annotation></semantics></math></span>, והקודקודים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math></span> עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ‏<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(4,0)</annotation></semantics></math></span> עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16-24=-8</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ‏<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,4)</annotation></semantics></math></span> עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הגדול ביותר הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span>, בקודקוד <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,4)</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
      },
