       "type": "numeric",
       "prompt": "מהו הערך המקסימלי של $f(x,y)=x+2y$ על המעגל $x^2+y^2=5$ ?",
       "answer": 5,
       "tol": 0,
       "explain": "$\\nabla f=(1,2)=\\lambda(2x,2y)$ נותן $1=2\\lambda x$ ו-$2=2\\lambda y$, ולכן $y=2x$. מהאילוץ $5x^2=5$, כלומר $x=\\pm1$ והנקודות $(1,2)$ ו-$(-1,-2)$. הערכים: $f(1,2)=5$ ו-$f(-1,-2)=-5$. המקסימום הוא $5$.",
       "promptHtml": "מהו הערך המקסימלי של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x,y)=x+2y</annotation></semantics></math></span> על המעגל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=5</annotation></semantics></math></span> ?",
       "explainHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla f=(1,2)=\\lambda(2x,2y)</annotation></semantics></math></span> נותן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1=2\\lambda x</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2=2\\lambda y</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=2x</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מהאילוץ <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5x^2=5</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\pm1</annotation></semantics></math></span> והנקודות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,2)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-1,-2)</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הערכים: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(1,2)=5</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(-1,-2)=-5</annotation></semantics></math></span>. המקסימום הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
