       "explainHtml": "מציבים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=y=1</annotation></semantics></math></span> במשוואה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=2\\lambda x</annotation></semantics></math></span> ומקבלים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1=2\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda=\\frac12</annotation></semantics></math></span>. בנקודה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> היה מתקבל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda=-\\frac12</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
