       "explainHtml": "מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=2\\lambda x</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=2\\lambda y</annotation></semantics></math></span> מקבלים (בהצבה) <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=4\\lambda^2y</annotation></semantics></math></span>. כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\ne0</annotation></semantics></math></span> (אחרת גם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math></span> והאילוץ לא מתקיים), <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda=\\pm\\frac12</annotation></semantics></math></span> ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\pm x</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מהאילוץ <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x^2=2</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\pm1</annotation></semantics></math></span>. ארבע נקודות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\pm1,\\pm1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
