       "explain": "בנקודות $(\\pm1,0)$ ו-$(0,\\pm1)$ מתקבל $f=1$. בנקודות $\\left(\\pm\\frac1{\\sqrt2},\\pm\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\right)$ מתקבל $f=\\frac14+\\frac14=\\frac12$. הקטן הוא $\\frac12=0.5$.",
       "promptHtml": "מהו הערך המינימלי של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x,y)=x^4+y^4</annotation></semantics></math></span> על המעגל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ? (תשובה עשרונית)",
       "explainHtml": "בנקודות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\pm1,0)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,\\pm1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקבל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>. בנקודות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>±</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>±</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left(\\pm\\frac1{\\sqrt2},\\pm\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקבל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=\\frac14+\\frac14=\\frac12</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הקטן הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac12=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
