       "explainHtml": "צריך את המקסימום של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos^2\\theta\\,|\\sin\\theta|</annotation></semantics></math></span>. עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span> זה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-s^2)s</annotation></semantics></math></span>, שמקסימומו ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=\\frac1{\\sqrt3}</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.385</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2}{3\\sqrt3}\\approx0.385</annotation></semantics></math></span>. כל קבוע גדול מזה, גם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span>, מספיק כדי להוכיח את הגבול."
