       "explainHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|r\\cos3\\theta|\\le r\\to0</annotation></semantics></math></span> ללא תלות ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן הגבול הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
