       "promptHtml": "מהו הסכום <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></munderover><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=2}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{3^n}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ? (שימו לב: הטור מתחיל מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=2</annotation></semantics></math></span>. אפשר לכתוב שבר, למשל 1/6).",
       "explainHtml": "האיבר הראשון הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac19</annotation></semantics></math></span> (ולא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac13</annotation></semantics></math></span>) והמנה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac13</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן הסכום הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dfrac{1/9}{1-1/3}=\\dfrac16</annotation></semantics></math></span>. התוצאה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac12</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקבלת אם מתחילים מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=1</annotation></semantics></math></span> בטעות."
