       "promptHtml": "מהו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\displaystyle D=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}</annotation></semantics></math></span> עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n=\\dfrac{n^2}{2^n}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ?",
